228 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /H2
  /P 227 0 R
  /T (There are many popular web frameworks, such as Angular, Vue, Svelte or Solid. In 2026, the most popular one is React. React is a library created by Facebook in 2013. Used by many big companies such as Facebook, Instagram, Netflix, Airbnb and smaller ones. React is based on components, which are reusable pieces of code that represent a part of the user interface (like functions but for UI). Components can be nested, managed and handled independently, which allows for complex applications to be built from simple building blocks.)
  /K [10 229 0 R]
  /Pg 624 0 R
>>
